flowchart LR
    O[Vendor Onboarding Service] --> DB[(PostgreSQL<br/>Source of Truth)]
    O --> B[(Event Bus)]

    B --> RM[Read Model Projector]
    RM --> RDB[(NoSQL Read Store<br/>DynamoDB / MongoDB)]

    B --> N[Notification]
    B --> A[Analytics]

    B -. optional .-> K[KYC Service]
    K --> KQ[(KYC Queue)]
    KQ --> W[OCR / Scan / Verification Workers]
    K --> OBJ[(Object Storage)]
    W --> OBJ
    W --> KDB[(KYC Database)]
